    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McCormack present to the market this great opportunity to acquire a luxurious, 4-bedroom, mid terrace home in Tullow's most desired residential gated community. Wolseley Park is part of the Mount Wolseley Hotel, Golf and Country Club estate and as such the house is ideally situated to take advantage of the 18-hole golf course, hotel facilities, gym, spa, swimming pool, 2 restaurants and the Aaron Lounge bar.\n\nThe property is presented in excellent condition throughout with bright clean décor and quality fixtures and fittings. Accommodation on the ground floor comprises of a bright entrance hall, living room, large spacious open plan kitchen/diner area and a guest WC. Upstairs you will find the 4 well-appointed bedrooms (master en-suite) and family bathroom. A bonus feature to this property is the balcony, which is accessed off the master bedroom through double doors and has space for a bistro table and 2 chairs.\n\nExternally there is off street parking to the front with additional owner and guest parking directly opposite the property with a neat lawn and hedged boundary. To the rear of the property, you find a very private garden which has a patio area with a fenced boundary. As an owner within the development, you have full access to the playground and tennis courts.\n\nHybrid Property Management Company\n850 per annum Management Fees\n\nDublin approx. 50 miles. Short walking distance to Tullow town centre amenities. Ideal opportunity for owner occupiers and investors alike.\n\nCall DNG McCormack to make an appointment to view 0599133800"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 2.19 x 2.85\nLaminate fooring, carpet on stairs, coving\n\nGuest WC - 0.88 x 1.88\nTiled flooring, WC, WHB\n\nLiving Room - 4.70 x 6.16\nLaminate flooring, solid fuel open fire with surround, coving\n\nKitchen/Diner - 7.41 x 3.41\nLaminate/tiled flooring, fully fitted units at eye and floor evel, coving, patio doors to rear, tiled splash back, recess lighting\n\nStorage - 0.78 x 1.78\n\n\nStorage - 0.88 x 2.68\n\n\nLanding - 3.73 x 1.76\nCarpet flooring, coving, attic access\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.75 x 4.63\nCarpet flooring, front aspect, double room, coving, balcony\n\nEn-suite - 2.62 x 1.43\nTiled floor and half wall, WC, WHB, shower\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.68 x 3.43\nCarpet flooring, rear aspect, double room, coving\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.67 x 3.43\nCarpet flooring, rear aspect, double room, coving\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.23 x 3.76\nCarpet flooring, front aspect, double room, coving\n\nBathroom - 2.57 x 1.74\nTiled floor and half wall, WC, WHB, bath with shower over\n\n"
